<section id="quality-over-qualntity">
  <h2>Quality over Quantity</h2>
  <p>
    Posting a position on LinkedIn or Indeed can bring in hundreds of resumes, but if you're looking for a needle in a
    haystack, that's just building a bigger haystack. ATS systems can help narrow the field but have serious
    shortcomings. They lack industry insight, they can't understand your company's culture, and they can easily overlook
    great candidates in favor of optimized resumes.
  </p>

  <p>We provide an alternative.</p>

  <p>
    We focus exclusively on property and casualty insurance, which means we know the industry, understand the roles, and
    speak the language. Instead of forwarding stacks of resumes, we identify qualified professionals, have real
    conversations with them, evaluate their experience, and introduce only candidates we believe are worth your time.
  </p>

  <p>
    Every search is personalized. We're focused on making the right match not filling the highest number of openings.
  </p>

  <div class="eyebrow">The difference</div>
  <h3>When you work with us you'll get:</h3>
  <ul class="feature-list">
    <li>Fewer resumes. Better candidates.</li>
    <li>Candidates who have been personally screened—not just keyword matched.</li>
    <li>Access to professionals who may not be actively applying online.</li>
    <li>A recruiting partner who understands the property and casualty insurance market.</li>
    <li>Direct communication from start to finish. No handoffs, no call centers.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

